                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I did want to check this game out on my own because of the bad reviews and i have to say: they are true!\nFor the money you pay its just far too less gameplay... I'm very disappointed :/ The game really is only like 15 minutes long. \nI have to admit that the game is sometimes quite funny, but everything else seems very unpolished and amateurish...\nAlso the voice acting of the barkeeper is horrible... you can clearly hear that the voice got downpitched in some crappy way :/\n\nThere are also some graphic bugs, like seeing the non existent cars headlights through the walls, but that wouldnt matter too hard if the game was actually good.\n\nI doubt that the other episodes will be better...\nNot worth the money... Save your lifetime and your money... :(",
